#* {{RQ:Saki Reginald in Russia|story=The Bag|page=76|passage=In '''ranging''' herself as a partisan on the side of Major Pallaby Mrs. Hoopington had been largely influenced by the fact that she had made up her mind to marry him at an early date.}}
