#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2023 November 1|author=Robert Drysdale|title=Leven is nearly back on track...|journal=RAIL|issue=995|page=58|text=The 2025 timetable would feature two trains per hour, alternately routed via Kirkcaldy (with 11 intermediate stops) and Dunfermline (14 stops), with journey times '''ranging''' between 65 and 81 minutes.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[classify]].
#: {{ux|en|to '''range''' plants and animals in genera and species}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1785| title=Travels Into Poland, Russia, Sweden, and Denmark|author=William Coxe | page=129| passage=The coins are '''ranged''' into nine classes.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2013| title=Integration of Process Knowledge into Design Support |author=Hubert Kals; Fred van Houten | page=378| passage=All requirements could be '''ranged''' into the classes. }}
