#* {{quote-book|en|year=1873|author=w:James Thomson (B.V.)|title=s:The City of Dreadful Night
|passage=The street-lamps burn amid the baleful glooms, / Amidst the soundless solitudes immense / Of '''ranged''' mansions dark and still as tombs.}}
